              "instruction": "ā paḻaya vīṭṭil oru prētaṁ uṇṭennŭ āḷukaḷ paṟayunnu. — People say there is a ghost in that old house.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *ā paḻaya vīṭṭil oru prētaṁ uṇṭennŭ āḷukaḷ paṟayunnu.* — People say there is a ghost in that old house.]"
