          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മാന്ത്രികൻ (māntrikan) is borrowed from Sanskrit māntrika, \"a reciter of spells, a sorcerer\" (CDIAL 10050), from mantra, \"a spell\"."
